  "notes": {
    "s0": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "The first-run flow. Every step is SparkOnboardingScaffold: one glyph, a Comfortaa hero, the reason, and a pinned action stack with a skip.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -154
    },
    "s1": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "The main surface. A paged window of days, each one hero, a stat strip, the anomaly pill, check-ins, and an hour-ruled timeline whose rows change weight with what the event is.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1060
    },
    "s2": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "The full-screen catch-up. A glass header carries the chaptered progress bar, the chapter and three 44pt controls; every card is spoken by Flint; the recap is a sheet you can reach at any point, and a note to Flint is always one tap away.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2274
    },
    "s3": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Five sections behind one tab-bar accessory: Health, Money, Metrics, Map and Tags, plus the money account screens.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3488
    },
    "s4": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Reading; Flint's four swipeable sections with its threads, digest reader and notes; and the prefix-driven search.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4702
    },
    "s5": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "One screen per entity in the Spark graph, all sharing SparkDetailHero, the section header, the linked row and the value tile.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5916
    },
    "s6": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "The settings sheet and its stack, plus connection health.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7130
    },
    "s7": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Presented from the sub-view toolbar and the detail screens.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8344
    },
    "s8": {
      "color": "gray",
      "size": 40,
      "text": "Widgets, Lock Screen accessories, StandBy, Live Activities and the share extension \u2014 every surface that shows Spark without the app being opened \u2014 and the eight states of the app background.",
      "w": 1180,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9558
    },
